d does not change the answer's correctness. Return only a JSON object with unsupported_probability and source_sentence_id. Use null when no visible source sentence is a proposed witness.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"complete_source\": \"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"712 N Milpas St\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":true,\\\"classy\\\":false,\\\"divey\\\":false,\\\"hipster\\\":false,\\\"intimate\\\":false,\\\"romantic\\\":false,\\\"touristy\\\":false,\\\"trendy\\\":false,\\\"upscale\\\":false},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":false,\\\"street\\\":true,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"no\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Mexican, Restaurants, Fish & Chips\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Santa Barbara\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"10:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"10:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"10:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"10:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"10:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"10:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"10:0-21:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Cesar's Place\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2022-01-02 04:49:15\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"There is no picture posted because I was hangry!!! Definitely delicious, hubby's michelada was the high light of the night. The asada quesadilla was amazing. I had the enchilada with shrimp in the white sauce. Good place for our first night here\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-12-11 19:07:43\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Visiting Santa Barbara and found this gem.\\\\nService was excellent, salsas were very Flavorful from the house salsa & guacamole. We order menudo & was not greasy & full of flavor, their hand made tortillas tops this dish, I got the green chilaquilles \\\\nNot to soggy & had just enough kick for me. Definitely will stop by here again when visiting\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-10-29 01:20:06\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Had a really good meal here tonight. Good service, clean restaurant. Plenty of room to eat inside restaurant.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"\\\"Cesar's Place\\\" is a Mexican restaurant located at 712 N Milpas St, Santa Barbara, CA. It operates from 10:00 am to 9:00 pm every day. The restaurant offers a variety of dishes including Fish & Chips. According to customer reviews, the restaurant is known for its delicious food such as asada quesadilla, enchilada with shrimp in white sauce, menudo, and green chilaquilles. The restaurant has received a commendable average rating of 4.0 stars, with customers praising the flavorsome salsas, the high-quality service, and the clean environment. The restaurant offers take-out services and is suitable for group dining. However, it does not provide WiFi, offer outdoor seating, or accept reservations. Parking is available on-street. The ambiance of the place is described as casual.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
